licensed under the MIT License. Specifically, the following files are Julia
ports of, or mirror the logic in, that project's `trnlib.py` and associated
figure scripts:

  - src/RinzelGolomb.jl   (Golomb-Rinzel TRN neuron model)
  - src/ClusterDetect.jl  (Pfeuty chi index and synchronisation-cluster grouping)
  - src/GraphUtils.jl      (gap-junction adjacency / Laplacian and partition sets)

